%N A398911 Number of partitions of {1,...,3*n} into 3-element subsets {x,y,z} such that the sums x+y+z are all distinct.
%e A398911 For n=2, all binomial(6,3)/2 = 10 partitions qualify, since 1+...+6 = 21 is odd.
